activation	Compute current body text	2026-10-20T07:47:25.3306599Z text: Support `lazy` imports\n\n\n**Is your feature request related to a problem? Please describe.**\n\nPython 3.15 adds support for the `lazy` soft keyword:\n\n* https://docs.python.org/3.15/whatsnew/3.15.html#whatsnew315-lazy-imports\n* https://peps.python.org/pep-0810/\n\nThis has now available for testing in Python 3.15.0a7:\n\n* (discuss.python.org/redacted)\n\n\n\n**Describe the solution you'd like**\n\nAdd support for the `lazy` soft keyword.\n\n\n\n\n**Describe alternatives you've considered**\n\n\n\nWait for the next Ruff release? (github/redacted)[.]com/astral-sh/ruff/issues/21305\n\n**Additional context**\n\n\n\n```python\nlazy import random\n\nif __name__ == "__main__":\n    print(random.randint(1, 6))\n```\n```console\n❯ black --version\nblack, 26.3.0 (compiled: yes)\nPython (CPython) 3.14.3\n\n❯ black 1.py\nerror: cannot format 1.py: Cannot parse: 1:5: lazy import random\n\nOh no! 💥 💔 💥\n1 file failed to reformat.\n```
activation	Compute current body text	2026-10-20T07:47:25.3325700Z title: Support `lazy` imports
activation	Compute current body text	2026-10-20T07:47:25.3355853Z body: **Is your feature request related to a problem? Please describe.**\n\nPython 3.15 adds support for the `lazy` soft keyword:\n\n* https://docs.python.org/3.15/whatsnew/3.15.html#whatsnew315-lazy-imports\n* https://peps.python.org/pep-0810/\n\nThis has now available for testing in Python 3.15.0a7:\n\n* (discuss.python.org/redacted)\n\n\n\n**Describe the solution you'd like**\n\nAdd support for the `lazy` soft keyword.\n\n\n\n\n**Describe alternatives you've considered**\n\n\n\nWait for the next Ruff release? (github/redacted)[.]com/astral-sh/ruff/issues/21305\n\n**Additional context**\n\n\n\n```python\nlazy import random\n\nif __name__ == "__main__":\n    print(random.randint(1, 6))\n```\n```console\n❯ black --version\nblack, 26.3.0 (compiled: yes)\nPython (CPython) 3.14.3\n\n❯ black 1.py\nerror: cannot format 1.py: Cannot parse: 1:5: lazy import random\n\nOh no! 💥 💔 💥\n1 file failed to reformat.\n```
